blic records)"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2257, "end": 2281, "text": "* Wycombe Wanderers F.C."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 166, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Călărași, casting a warm orange glow over the sleepy town, Craig Dobson made his way to the FC Dunărea Călărași stadium."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 167, "end": 284, "text": "The British footballer, with his rugged good looks and chiseled physique, had become a familiar sight in these parts."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 285, "end": 386, "text": "The locals had grown fond of him, and he of them, since his transfer to the Romanian club a year ago."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 387, "end": 513, "text": "As he walked through the gates, the sound of children's laughter and the thud of footballs being kicked around filled the air."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 514, "end": 588, "text": "Craig smiled, feeling a sense of belonging he hadn't experienced in years."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 589, "end": 724, "text": "He exchanged nods and hellos with the groundskeepers, who were busy preparing the pitch for the upcoming match against Rapid București."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 725, "end": 822, "text": "In the locker room, Craig's teammates were already gathered, sipping coffee and swapping stories."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 823, "end": 1066, "text": "There was Alexandru, the team's captain, with his bushy eyebrows and wise, old eyes; Marius, the young winger, with his lightning-fast speed and mischievous grin; and of course, Coach Popescu, with his thick, grey mustache and perpetual scowl."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1067, "end": 1178, "text": "As Craig changed into his gear, he caugh